   "note": "drawing - the side view of a ring and the front view of five: see the contract. THE SPECIFICATION SHEET AND THE DRAWING DISAGREE on one figure: page 2 labels the 3.50 in dimension \"76.2 mm [3.50 in]\", which is 3.00 in. The drawing's dimension reads 3.5, its line work puts the inner leg 88.9 mm from the plate, and the application note's usable area of 1.25 in x 3.25 in agrees, so 88.9 is taken."
  },
